B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2A%2A%20Only%20an%20explicitly%20historical%20caller%20uses%20this%20exact%20checkpoint%E2%86%928d%20view.%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20restoreReviewedOverlayProviderModuleSource%28source%2Cfile%2CsourceCommit%3Dnull%29%7B%0A%20%20if%28%21file.startsWith%28%27js%2Fsrc%2F%27%29%29return%20source%3B%0A%20%20const%20module%3Dfile.slice%28%27js%2Fsrc%2F%27.length%29%2Cpacket%3DreadReviewedOverlayProviderSuccession%28%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20target%3DsourceCommit%3D%3D%3Dnull%3F0%3Apacket.profiles.findIndex%28row%3D%3Erow.sourceCommit%3D%3D%3DsourceCommit%29%3B%0A%20%20assert.ok%28target%3E%3D0%2C%27one%20actual%20certified%20source%20epoch%20selects%20the%20historical%20view%27%29%3B%0A%20%20let%20historical%3Dsource%3B%0A%20%20for%28const%20profile%20of%20packet.profiles.slice%28target%2B1%29.toReversed%28%29%29%7B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20row%3Dprofile.certificates.find%28row%3D%3Erow.module%3D%3D%3Dmodule%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20if%28row%26%26historical%3D%3D%3Drow.current.source%29historical%3Drow.previous.source%3B%0A%20%20%7D%0A%20%20return%20historical%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%0Aexport%20function%20deriveReviewedOverlayProviderPolicy%28packet%29%7B%0A%20%20const%20original%3Dpacket.historicalOutputs%5B0%5D%2Cpolicy%3DreadStructuredDataLino%28original.source%29%3B%0A%20%20assert.equal%28policy.revisions.at%28-1%29.sourceCommit%2Cpacket.previousSourceCommit%29%3B%0A%20%20policy.revisions.push%28...packet.profiles%29%3Breturn%20policy%3B%0A%7D%0A%0Afunction%20verifyReviewedOverlayProviderEpoch%28packet%2Cindex%29%7B%0A%20%20const%20profile%3Dpacket.profiles%5Bindex%5D%2Cepoch%3Dprofile.epoch%3B%0A%20%20const%20review%3Dprofile.previousSourceCommit%3D%3D%3DOVERLAY_PROVIDER_APPEND_REVIEW.previous%3FOVERLAY_PROVIDER_APPEND_REVIEW%3AOVERLAY_PROVIDER_REFERENCE_REVIEW%3B%0A%20%20const%20reviewed%3Dreview.modules%3F%3F%5Breview%5D%3B%0A%20%20exactKeys%28epoch%2C%5B%27reviewKind%27%2C%27predecessorPacket%27%2C%27predecessorOutputs%27%5D%29%3B%0A%20%20assert.equal%28epoch.re