ion%20generateCurrentOwnCodebaseRawSourceDescriptors%28%7Bcheck%3Dfalse%7D%3D%7B%7D%29%7B%0A%20%20const%20policy%3DreadCurrentOwnCodebaseRawDescriptorPolicy%28%29%3B%0A%20%20%2F%2F%20A%20second%20normal%20refresh%20may%20follow%20more%20source%20edits%20within%20the%20same%20batch.%0A%20%20%2F%2F%20Authenticate%20the%20complete%20installed%20packet%20with%20its%20existing%20digest%20and%0A%20%20%2F%2F%20certificates%20before%20deriving%20its%20exact%20three%20whole-output%20write%20preimages.%0A%20%20const%20recorded%3DexistsSync%28new%20URL%28policy.output%2Croot%29%29%3FreadCurrentOwnCodebaseRawDescriptorPacket%28%29%3Anull%3B%0A%20%20const%20recordedOutputs%3Drecorded%3FderiveCurrentOwnCodebaseRawDescriptorOutputs%28recorded%29.outputs%3A%5B%5D%3B%0A%20%20const%20capture%3Dfile%3D%3E%7Bconst%7Bblob%2Ccertificate%7D%3DcaptureGitArtifactCertificate%28policy.revision%2Cfile%29%3Bassert.equal%28Buffer.from%28blob.toString%28%27utf8%27%29%29.equals%28blob%29%2Ctrue%29%3Breturn%7Bfile%2Ccommit%3Apolicy.revision%2C...pin%28blob%29%2CsourceText%3Ablob.toString%28%27utf8%27%29%2Ccertificate%2Ccurrent%3Anull%7D%3B%7D%3B%0A%20%20const%5Bartifact%2Cregister%2Cloan%5D%3D%5Bpolicy.artifactFile%2Cpolicy.registerFile%2Cpolicy.loanFile%5D.map%28capture%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20old%3DreadStructuredDataLino%28artifact.sourceText%29%2Cproof%3Dold.predecessor.proof.producerApplicability%3B%0A%20%20const%20sources%3Dpolicy.sourcePaths.map%28%28file%2Cindex%29%3D%3E%7B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20row%3Dcapture%28file%29%2CsourceText%3DreadFileSync%28new%20URL%28file%2Croot%29%2C%27utf8%27%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20result%3D%7B...row%2Ccurrent%3A%7B...pin%28sourceText%29%2CsourceText%7D%2CartifactPrevious%3AstructuredClone%28old.decisionSources%5Bpolicy.decisionIndices%5Bindex%5D%5D%29%2Cedits%3Aintervals%28row.sourceText%2CsourceText%29%7D%3B%0A%20%20%20%20assert.equal%28result.artifactPrevious.file%2Cfile%29%3Bassert.notEqual%28result.current.sha256%2Cresult.artifactPrevious.sha256%2C%27each%20selected%20actual%20descriptor%20needs%20this%20edge%3A%20%27%2Bfile%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20deriveCurrentOwnCodebaseRawDescriptorSource%28result%29%3Breturn%20result%3B%0A%20%20%7D%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20adapters%3Dpolicy.adapterPaths.map%28file%3D%3E%7Bconst%20row%3Dcapture%28file%29%2CsourceText%3DadapterSource%28file%2Crow.sourceText%29%3Breturn%7B...row%2Ccurrent%3A%7B...pin%28sourceText%29%2CsourceText%7D%2Cedits%3Aintervals%28row.sourceText%2CsourceText%29%7D%3B%7D%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20inferenceDescriptorAlias%3Dproof.sources.find%28row%3D%3Erow.file%3D%3D%3Dpolicy.sourcePaths%5B1%5D%29%3D%3D%3Dproof.sourceHistory.current%3B%0A%20%20const%20packet%3D%7BschemaVersion%3Apolicy.schemaVersion%2Cmodel%3Apolicy.model%2Crevision%3Apolicy.revision%2Cartifact%2Cregister%2Cloan%2Csources%2Cadapters%2CinferenceDescriptorAlias%2Cedge%3Anull%2C%0A%20%20%20%20boundary%3A%27One%20additive%20provenance%20edge%20updates%20three%20actual%20source%20descriptors%20and%20both%20logical%20inference-proof%20descriptor%20paths.%20Complete%20emitted%20definitions%2C%20archives%2C%20fixtures%2C%20mappings%2C%20prior%20receipts%20and%20policies%20retain%20exact%20whole-byte%20inverses.%20This%20supplies%20no%20semantic-equivalence%20or%20native-execution%20evidence.%27%7D%3B%0A%20%20const%20result%3DderiveCurrentOwnCodebaseRawDescriptorOutputs%28packet%29%3Bpacket.edge%3Dresult.edge%3B%0A%20%20for%28const%20row%20of%5Bartifact%2Cregister%2Cloan%5D%29row.current%3Dpin%28result.outputs.find%28output%3D%3Eoutput.file%3D%3D%3Drow.file%29.source%29%3B%0A%20%20verifyCurrentOwnCodebaseRawDescriptorRefresh%28packet%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20writes%3D%5B...result.outputs.map%28row%3D%3E%28%7B...row%2Cprevious%3A%5Bartifact%2Cregister%2Cloan%5D.find%28input%3D%3Einput.file%3D%3D%3Drow.file%29.sourceText%7D%29%29%2C%0A%20%20%20%20...adapters.map%28row%3D%3E%28%7Bfile%3Arow.file%2Csource%3AderiveCurrentOwnCodebaseRawDescriptorSource%28row%29%2Cprevious%3Arow.sourceText%7D%29%29%5D%3B%0A%20%20%2F%2F%20V