(67305: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %23%21%2Fusr%2Fbin%2Fenv%20node%0A%2F%2F%20Generates%20the%20export%20parity%20map%20of%20requirement%0A%2F%2F%20I195-PARITY-FEATURE-COMPLETENESS%3A%20the%20%60javascriptExports%60%20object%20of%0A%2F%2F%20parity%2Flanguage-features.json%2C%20one%20entry%20per%20public%20export%20of%0A%2F%2F%20js%2Fsrc%2Findex.js%20naming%20the%20public%20Rust%20item%20that%20carries%20the%20same%20feature%2C%0A%2F%2F%20and%20rust%2Ftests%2Funit%2Fjavascript_export_parity.rs%2C%20which%20references%20every%20one%0A%2F%2F%20of%20those%20items%20through%20%60meta_language%3A%3A%60%20so%20the%20Rust%20compiler%20proves%20each%0A%2F%2F%20exists%20and%20is%20public.%0A%2F%2F%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20node%20js%2Fscripts%2Fgenerate-export-parity.mjs%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%23%20write%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20node%20js%2Fscripts%2Fgenerate-export-parity.mjs%20--check%20%20%23%20verify%0A%2F%2F%0A%2F%2F%20An%20export%20resolves%20by%20convention%20%28camelCase%20becomes%20snake_case%3B%20PascalCase%0A%2F%2F%20and%20UPPER_CASE%20names%20are%20kept%29%20to%20the%20shortest%20public%20path%20of%20a%20Rust%20item%20of%0A%2F%2F%20that%20name%2C%20or%20through%20OVERRIDES%20for%20exports%20whose%20Rust%20counterpart%20is%20a%0A%2F%2F%20method%20or%20carries%20another%20name.%20An%20export%20that%20resolves%20to%20nothing%20fails%20the%0A%2F%2F%20generator%2C%20so%20a%20new%20JavaScript%20export%20cannot%20land%20without%20its%20Rust%20feature.%0Aimport%20%7B%20readFileSync%2C%20writeFileSync%2C%20existsSync%2C%20mkdirSync%20%7D%20from%20%27node%3Afs%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20readProjectData%2C%20resolveProjectDataPath%2C%20serializeProjectData%20%7D%20from%20%27.%2Fproject-data.mjs%27%3B%0Aimport%20path%20from%20%27node%3Apath%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20fileURLToPath%20%7D%20from%20%27node%3Aurl%27%3B%0A%0Aconst%20root%20%3D%20path.resolve%28path.dirname%28fileURLToPath%28import.meta.url%29%29%2C%20%27..%2F..%27%29%3B%0Aconst%20featuresPath%20%3D%20p