0and%20cross-record%20references.%20Both%20package%20readers%20and%20repository%20tooling%20retain%20their%20observable%20behavior%2C%20and%20conversion%20does%20not%20reduce%20protected%20requirement%20scope.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27structuredDataConversionAutomated%27%2C%20%27convertedValuesLosslesslyReconstructed%27%2C%20%27identitiesOrderNumbersStringsAliasesAndReferencesPreserved%27%2C%20%27fixtureIdsAndAcceptanceAssertionsPreserved%27%2C%20%27packageReadersAndToolingBehaviorPreserved%27%2C%20%27protectedScopeNotReduced%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-ASSOCIATIVE-DATA-JSON-EXCEPTIONS%27%2C%20%27JSON%20retained%20only%20for%20necessary%20declared%20external%20interfaces%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27JSON%20remains%20only%20where%20a%20genuine%20external%20standard%20or%20source-language%20JSON%20interface%20requires%20it%2C%20with%20an%20explicit%20recorded%20necessity%20and%20boundary.%20Convenience%2C%20an%20existing%20JSON%20file%20or%20an%20opaque%20payload%20does%20not%20establish%20an%20exception%3B%20the%20project-owned%20authoritative%20representation%20remains%20linked%20data%20wherever%20the%20interface%20permits%20it.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27jsonExceptionsHaveExplicitNecessity%27%2C%20%27externalJsonInterfaceBoundariesRecorded%27%2C%20%27noConvenienceOrOpaquePayloadException%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%5D%2C%20true%29%2C%0A%20%20...rows%28%27externalGrammarStorageRequest%27%2C%20externalGrammarSource%2C%20%27temporary-external-grammar-inputs%27%2C%20%27external-grammar-storage%27%2C%20%5B%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-EXTERNAL-GRAMMAR-UNTRACKED%27%2C%20%27upstream%20external%20grammar%20and%20parser%20assets%20excluded%20from%20version%20control%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Upstream%20external%20raw%20grammars%2C%20parser%20sources%2C%20compiled%20parsers%20and%20WebAssembly%20assets%20are%20not%20tracked%20in%20the%20repository.%20The%20project-generated%20native%20or%20meta-language%20Links%20Notation%20grammars%20and%20prepared%20snapshots%20remain%20permitted%20and%20preserve%20all%20inherited%20grammar%2C%20provenance%20and%20offline%20production%20requirements.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27externalUpstreamAssetsUntracked%27%2C%20%27generatedNativeSnapshotsRetained%27%2C%20%27inheritedOfflineAndProvenanceRequirementsPreserved%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-EXTERNAL-GRAMMAR-TEMPORARY-DOWNLOAD%27%2C%20%27temporary%20pinned%20external%20grammar%20inputs%20with%20checked%20provenance%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27A%20reproducible%20tool%20downloads%20upstream%20external%20grammar%20and%20oracle%20assets%20temporarily%20when%20import%2C%20regeneration%20or%20independent%20tests%20require%20them%2C%20verifies%20their%20pinned%20checksums%20and%20records%20revision%2C%20origin%20and%20license%20provenance.%20Downloaded%20inputs%20remain%20outside%20tracked%20files%2C%20temporary%20assets%20are%20cleaned%20after%20use%2C%20and%20generated%20native%20snapshots%20remain%20independently%20usable%20without%20those%20assets.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27temporaryDownloaderExecuted%27%2C%20%27pinnedChecksumsVerified%27%2C%20%27downloadProvenanceRetained%27%2C%20%27downloadedAssetsUntracked%27%2C%20%27temporaryAssetsCleaned%27%2C%20%27generatedSnapshotsUsableWithoutDownloads%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%5D%2C%20true%29%2C%0A%20%20...rows%28%27externalGrammarIgnoreRequest%27%2C%20externalGrammarIgnoreSource%2C%20%27temporary-external-grammar-inputs%27%2C%20%27external-grammar-storage%27%2C%20%5B%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-EXTERNAL-GRAMMAR-IGNORED-DIRECTORY%27%2C%20%27external%20grammar%20download%20folders%20explicitly%20ignored%20by%20Git%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Every%20folder%20used%20for%20external%20grammar%2C%20parser%20or%20oracle%20downloads%20is%20explicitly%20covered%20by%20Git%20ignore%20rules%2C%20so%20ordinary%20staging%20cannot%20add%20downloaded%20inputs.%20Ignore%20rules%20preserve%20the%20project-generated%20native%20Links%20Notation%20grammars%2C%20source%20manifests%2C%20checksums%20and%20pr