ing%20from%20holdout%20evaluation%20and%20test%20adversarial%20rejections%20and%20real%20projects%20under%20several%20independent%20oracles.%20Record%20precision%2C%20recall%2C%20F1%2C%20CST%20fields%2C%20trivia%2C%20spans%2C%20attributed%20behavior%2C%20reconstruction%2C%20grammar%20size%2C%20determinism%2C%20query%20counts%2C%20elapsed%20time%20and%20peak%20memory.%27%2C%20%5B%27trainingAndHoldoutSeparated%27%2C%20%27multipleIndependentOraclesAndProjectsUsed%27%2C%20%27allRequiredQualityAndResourceMetricsRecorded%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-GRAMMAR-INFERENCE-COMPARATIVE-BENCHMARKS%27%2C%20%27reproducible%20inference%20comparison%20within%20common%20budgets%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Benchmark%20existing%20inference%20and%20selected%20modern%20methods%20with%20the%20same%20pinned%20workloads%20and%20budgets.%20Retain%20all%20failures%20and%20disagreement%20traces%2C%20select%20reproducible%20improvements%20without%20weakening%20acceptance%2C%20and%20keep%20statistical%20coverage%20distinct%20from%20semantic%20proof.%27%2C%20%5B%27commonBudgetsAndWorkloadsUsed%27%2C%20%27failuresAndDisagreementsRetained%27%2C%20%27reproducibleImprovementMeasured%27%2C%20%27statisticsNotPresentedAsProof%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-GRAMMAR-INFERENCE-CI-RESOURCE-POLICY%27%2C%20%27bounded%20JavaScript-first%20inference%20development%20and%20CI%20artifacts%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Use%20targeted%20JavaScript%20authoring%20locally%3B%20run%20Rust%20compilation%2C%20broad%20discovery%20experiments%2C%20whole%20corpora%20and%20downstream%20workloads%20in%20CI%20with%20bounded%20caches%20and%20per-run%20artifacts.%20Record%20critical%20scope%2C%20API%20parity%20and%20exact%20executed%20observations%20without%20completion%20claims%20for%20missing%20behavior.%27%2C%20%5B%27javascriptFirstInferenceDevelopment%27%2C%20%27expensiveInferenceAndRustRunInCI%27%2C%20%27boundedCachesAndRunArtifacts%27%2C%20%27exactEvidenceAndApiParityRecorded%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%5D%2C%20true%29%2C%0A%20%20...rows%28%27grammarInferenceIssue%27%2C%20inferenceSource%2C%20%27dynamic-knowledge-and-language-extension%27%2C%20%27grammar-inference%27%2C%20%5B%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-GRAMMAR-INFERENCE-PUBLIC-API-CLI%27%2C%20%27matching%20public%20grammar%20discovery%20library%20and%20CLI%20interfaces%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27JavaScript%20and%20Rust%20library%20and%20CLI%20interfaces%20accept%20pinned%20positive%20and%20negative%20examples%2C%20independent%20membership%20or%20parser%20oracles%2C%20optional%20execution%20traces%20and%20existing%20grammars.%20Diagnostics%20identify%20unresolved%20context%20sensitivity%2C%20scanners%20and%20action%20semantics%20rather%20than%20silently%20approximating%20them.%27%2C%20%5B%27matchingDiscoveryApiAndCliExecuted%27%2C%20%27examplesOraclesTracesAndSourcesAccepted%27%2C%20%27unsupportedSemanticsPreciselyDiagnosed%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-GRAMMAR-INFERENCE-NATIVE-OUTPUT%27%2C%20%27fully%20native%20executable%20discovered%20grammars%20and%20attributed%20behavior%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Discovery%20emits%20executable%20Links%20grammars%20with%20lossless%20CST%20structure%2C%20lexer%20and%20scanner%20state%2C%20precedence%2C%20ambiguity%2C%20recovery%20and%20attributed%20semantic%20actions.%20Foreign%20parser%20blobs%2C%20opaque%20sources%20and%20host%20callbacks%20cannot%20stand%20in%20for%20native%20operational%20definitions.%27%2C%20%5B%27discoveredGrammarNativeAndExecutable%27%2C%20%27discoveredCstAndScannerSemanticsPreserved%27%2C%20%27attributedActionsAndRecoveryExplicit%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-GRAMMAR-INFERENCE-GENERIC-UNION%27%2C%20%27generic%20structural%20and%20semantic%20discovery%20through%20the%20source-union%20pipeline%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Discover%20lexical%20classes%2C%20recursion%20and%20semantic%20relations%20generically%2C%20preserving%20every%20source%20production%20and%20provenance.%20Merge%20discovered%20definitions%20with%20the%20applicable%20official%20and%20mature%20grammars%20through%20the%20existing%20automatic%20native%20pipeline.%27%2C%20%5B%27lexicalRecursiveAndSemanticDiscoveryExecuted%27%2C%20%27allSourceProductionsAndProvenanceRetained%27%2C%20%27discoveredAndOfficialGrammarsMerged%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-GRAMMAR-INFERENCE-FORMAL-CONCEPT-INTEGRATION%27%2C%20%27discovered%20concepts%20integrated%20with%20recursive%20formal%20definitions%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Copy%20discovered%20concepts%20into%20the%20single%20global%20space%20with%20formal%20definitions%20that%20recursively%20reference%20other%20linked%20concepts.%20Deduplicate%20only%20checked%20context-preserving%20one-to-one%20meaning%20certificates%3B%20equal%20strings%2C%20names%2C%20glosses%20or%20finite%20samples%20do%20not%20establish%20equivalence%2C%20and%20unresolved%20alternatives%20survive.%27%2C%20%5B%27discoveredConceptsAndFormalDefinitionsLinked%27%2C%20%27contextPreservingMeaningCertificatesChecked%27%2C%20%27unresolvedDiscoveryAlternativesPreserved%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-GRAMMAR-INFERENCE-DETERMINISTIC-REFINEMENT%27%2C%20%27deterministic%20counterexample-guided%20incremental%20discovery%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Seeded%20discovery%20is%20deterministic%20and%20supports%20counterexample-guided%20refinement%2C%20incremental%20updates%20and%20checkpoint%20resume%20without%20losing%20the%20examples%2C%20decisions%2C%20assumptions%20or%20rejected%20alternatives%20used%20to%20obtain%20the%20grammar.%27%2C%20%5B%27seededDiscoveryDeterministic%27%2C%20%27counterexampleAndIncrementalRefinementExecuted%27%2C%20%27checkpointResumeRetainsEvidence%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-GRAMMAR-INFERENCE-SOURCE-FREE-SNAPSHOTS%27%2C%20%27source-free%20discovered%20grammar%20snapshots%20in%20text%20and%20versioned%20binary%20links%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Discovered%20snapshots%20restore%20and%20extend%20through%20link-cli%2C%20text%20Links%20Notation%20and%20a%20versioned%20binary%20links%20representation%20without%20their%20original%20source%20buffers%2C%20retaining%20identities%2C%20cycles%2C%20roots%2C%20full%20CSTs%20and%20proofs.%27%2C%20%5B%27discoverySnapshotsReloadWithoutSource%27%2C%20%27linkCliTextAndVersionedBinaryAgree%27%2C%20%27snapshotIdentitiesRootsTreesAndProofsRetained%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-GRAMMAR-INFERENCE-DYNAMIC-TRANSLATION%27%2C%20%27discovered%20languages%20execute%20and%20translate%20in%20the%20generic%20runtime%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27After%20installing%20a%20discovered%20language%20dynamically%2C%20ordinary%20parsing%20and%20Rust%2FJavaScript%20translation%20execute%20through%20the%20common%20algorithms.%20Changing%20a%20linked%20definition%20changes%20execution%20without%20changing%20the%20generic%20host%20runtime%3B%20stale%20certificates%20and%20incompatible%20definitions%20are%20rejected%20or%20revalidated%20explicitly.%27%2C%20%5B%27discoveredLanguageParsesAndTranslates%27%2C%20%27linkedMutationChangesGenericExecution%27%2C%20%27staleCertificatesRejectedOrRevalidated%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%5D%29%2C%0A%20%20...rows%28%27dynamicKnowledgeRequest%27%2C%20dynamicSource%2C%20%27dynamic-knowledge-and-language-extension%27%2C%20%27dynamic-knowledge%27%2C%20%5B%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-KNOWLEDGE-RDF-SUPPORT%27%2C%20%27full%20Resource%20Description%20Framework%20representation%20and%20operations%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Both%20packages%20preserve%20the%20complete%20required%20RDF%20constructs%2C%20identities%2C%20relationships%2C%20literals%2C%20provenance%20and%20selected%20semantics%20as%20inspectable%20links.%20A%20finite%20triple%20example%20or%20opaque%20payload%20does%20not%20establish%20full%20RDF%20support.%27%2C%20%5B%27rdfConstructsPreserved%27%2C%20%27rdfSemanticsAndProvenanceExplicit%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-KNOWLEDGE-OWL-SUPPORT%27%2C%20%27full%20Web%20Ontology%20Language%20representation%20and%20operations%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Both%20packages%20represent%20the%20required%20OWL%20constructs%2C%20formal%20axioms%20and%20chosen%20semantic%20profiles%20as%20links%2C%20preserving%20distinctions%20and%20obligations%20without%20silently%20replacing%20the%20consumer%20foundation.%27%2C%20%5B%27owlConstructsAndAxiomsPreserved%27%2C%20%27owlSemanticProfilesExplicit%27%2C%20%27consumerFoundationRetained%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-KNOWLEDGE-RDF-OWL-IMPORT%27%2C%20%27complete%20RDF%20and%20OWL%20importers%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Public%20importers%20in%20both%20packages%20import%20required%20RDF%20and%20OWL%20representations%20into%20the%20common%20concept%20and%20links%20space%20with%20their%20full%20structure%2C%20provenance%20and%20explicit%20diagnostics%20for%20unresolved%20obligations.%27%2C%20%5B%27rdfAndOwlPublicImportersExecuted%27%2C%20%27importedKnowledgeStructureAndProvenanceRetained%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-KNOWLEDGE-RDF-OWL-CONVERSION%27%2C%20%27faithful%20RDF%20and%20OWL%20conversion%20cycles%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Public%20converters%20and%20exporters%20in%20both%20packages%20execute%20faithful%20knowledge-format%20conversion%20cycles%20from%20the%20shared%20representation%20without%20returning%20a%20saved%20input%20or%20silently%20weakening%20axioms%20and%20identities.%27%2C%20%5B%27knowledgeConversionCyclesExecuted%27%2C%20%27knowledgeAxiomsAndIdentitiesPreserved%27%2C%20%27noSavedInputConversionShortcut%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-KNOWLEDGE-RDF-OWL-MERGE%27%2C%20%27meaning-preserving%20RDF%20and%20OWL%20merges%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Both%20packages%20merge%20imported%20RDF%20and%20OWL%20knowledge%20through%20the%20common%20links%20space%2C%20deduplicating%20only%20proved%20correspondences%20while%20retaining%20unique%20concepts%2C%20conflicting%20axioms%2C%20uncertainty%20and%20source-qualified%20provenance.%27%2C%20%5B%27knowledgeMergesExecuted%27%2C%20%27knowledgeDeduplicationProved%27%2C%20%27conflictsAndUncertaintyPreserved%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-DYNAMIC-SNAPSHOT-RECONSTRUCTION%27%2C%20%27static%20snapshot%20becomes%20a%20complete%20dynamic%20representation%20on%20demand%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27A%20prepared%20static%20snapshot%20can%20be%20reconstructed%20on%20demand%20into%20the%20complete%20CST%20and%20concept%20space%2C%20retaining%20rules%2C%20formal%20definitions%2C%20identities%2C%20recursive%20links%2C%20source%20bytes%20and%20provenance%20instead%20of%20reconstructing%20a%20token%20list%20or%20descriptor.%27%2C%20%5B%27snapshotReconstructsFullCst%27%2C%20%27snapshotReconstructsFullConceptSpace%27%2C%20%27dynamicReconstructionRetainsProvenance%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-DYNAMIC-RECONSTRUCTION-RESOURCE-MEASUREMENT%27%2C%20%27measured%20latency%20and%20resources%20for%20complete%20dynamic%20reconstruction%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Both%20packages%20measure%20actual%20complete%20CST%20and%20concept-space%20reconstruction%20through%20the%20public%20link-cli%2C%20text%20Links%20Notation%20and%20binary%20Links%20Notation%20paths.%20Measurements%20record%20reconstruction%20latency%20and%20peak%20resources%20together%20with%20pinned%20input%20identity%2C%20representation%2C%20size%2C%20algorithm%20and%20execution%20environment%20provenance.%20The%20reconstructed%20graphs%20preserve%20the%20complete%20trees%2C%20rules%2C%20recursive%20formal%20definitions%2C%20identities%2C%20references%2C%20selected%20models%2C%20source%20bytes%20and%20provenance.%20Lazy%20loading%2C%20token-only%20reconstruction%20and%20descriptor%20creation%20cannot%20count%20as%20a%20measured%20full%20rebuild.%20These%20measurements%20retain%20the%20source%20qualitative%20speed%20requirement%20without%20inventing%20a%20numeric%20deadline.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27completeDynamicReconstructionMeasured%27%2C%20%27reconstructionLatencyAndResourcesRecorded%27%2C%20%27measurementInputAndEnvironmentProvenanceRetained%27%2C%20%27fullRepresentationPreservationRetained%27%2C%20%27lazyOrTokenOnlyReconstructionNotCounted%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-DYNAMIC-LINK-CLI-RECONSTRUCTION%27%2C%20%27dynamic%20reconstruction%20through%20link-cli%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27The%20dynamic%20representation%20can%20be%20recreated%20and%20processed%20through%20link-cli%20with%20a%20reproducible%20public%20path%2C%20preserving%20the%20complete%20trees%2C%20concept%20definitions%20and%20selected%20model.%27%2C%20%5B%27linkCliReconstructionExecuted%27%2C%20%27linkCliPreservesFullTreesAndConcepts%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-DYNAMIC-TEXT-LINKS-RECONSTRUCTION%27%2C%20%27dynamic%20reconstruction%20from%20text%20Links%20Notation%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Text%20Links%20Notation%20can%20serialize%2C%20reload%20and%20extend%20the%20complete%20dynamic%20CST%20and%20concept%20space%20without%20the%20original%20grammar%20or%20source%20buffers.%27%2C%20%5B%27textLinksDynamicRoundTripExecuted%27%2C%20%27textLinksPreservesCompleteRepresentation%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-DYNAMIC-BINARY-LINKS-RECONSTRUCTION%27%2C%20%27dynamic%20reconstruction%20from%20binary%20Links%20Notation%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Binary%20Links%20Notation%20can%20serialize%2C%20reload%20and%20extend%20the%20same%20complete%20dynamic%20representation%20with%20parity%20to%20its%20text%20form%20and%20without%20hidden%20authoritative%20side%20tables.%27%2C%20%5B%27binaryLinksDynamicRoundTripExecuted%27%2C%20%27textAndBinaryDynamicRepresentationsAgree%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-DYNAMIC-LANGUAGE-EXTENSION%27%2C%20%27algorithmic%20runtime%20extension%20with%20other%20languages%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Users%20can%20apply%20the%20shared%20algorithms%20to%20extend%20the%20dynamic%20meta-language%20with%20new%20languages%2C%20grammars%20and%20formal%20concepts.%20Extensions%20retain%20the%20global%20concept%20space%2C%20validation%2C%20source%20provenance%20and%20default%20behavior%20of%20existing%20catalog%20languages.%27%2C%20%5B%27dynamicLanguageExtensionExecuted%27%2C%20%27extensionUsesSharedAlgorithms%27%2C%20%27existingLanguageBehaviorPreserved%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%5D%29%2C%0A%20%20...rows%28%27dynamicKnowledgeRequest%27%2C%20dynamicSource%2C%20%27dynamic-knowledge-and-language-extension%27%2C%20%27grammar-inference%27%2C%20%5B%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-GRAMMAR-INFERENCE-SEPARATE-ISSUE%27%2C%20%27separate%20tracked%20automatic%20grammar%20inference%20issue%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27A%20separate%20repository%20issue%20records%20automatic%20grammar%20inference%20and%20discovery%20with%20modern%20primary%20research%2C%20concrete%20algorithm%20obligations%2C%20source%20provenance%2C%20behavioral%20acceptance%20and%20links%20back%20to%20this%20critical%20scope.%20Creating%20the%20issue%20does%20not%20satisfy%20inference%20implementation.%27%2C%20%5B%27separateInferenceIssueCreated%27%2C%20%27modernResearchAndAcceptanceRecorded%27%2C%20%27issueDoesNotSubstituteImplementation%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%5D%2C%20true%29%2C%0A%20%20...rows%28%27dynamicKnowledgeRequest%27%2C%20dynamicSource%2C%20%27dynamic-knowledge-and-language-extension%27%2C%20%27grammar-inference%27%2C%20%5B%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-GRAMMAR-INFERENCE-AUTOMATIC-DISCOVERY%27%2C%20%27automatic%20grammar%20inference%20through%20research-backed%20algorithms%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Both%20packages%20discover%20or%20infer%20grammar%20definitions%20using%20recorded%20modern%20research%20and%20explicit%20assumptions%2C%20then%20validate%20and%20integrate%20the%20inferred%20definitions%20through%20the%20native%20pipeline%20and%20concept%20space%20with%20independent%20accepted%20and%20rejected%20observations.%27%2C%20%5B%27automaticGrammarDiscoveryExecuted%27%2C%20%27researchAndAssumptionsPinned%27%2C%20%27inferredGrammarsIndependentlyValidated%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%5D%29%2C%0A%20%20...rows%28%27translationPriorityRequest%27%2C%20translationSource%2C%20%27critical-conversation-requirements%27%2C%20%27translation-priority%27%2C%20%5B%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-TRANSLATION-PRIORITY-RUST%27%2C%20%27immediate%20bidirectional%20Rust%20and%20meta-language%20translation%20p